1
00:00:00,357 --> 00:00:02,397
(Howard:)Yeah, right.

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:05,400
(Howard:)-Dr. Plimpton?
-Hi.

3
00:00:05,571 --> 00:00:07,821
(Elizabeth:)-Howard, right?
-Uh, yeah.

4
00:00:08,032 --> 00:00:10,032
(Elizabeth:)Can I ask you a question, Howard?

5
00:00:10,201 --> 00:00:11,991
(Elizabeth:)Do you like role-playing games?

6
00:00:14,163 --> 00:00:15,833
Yeah, sure. Heh.

7
00:00:15,998 --> 00:00:18,538
(Howard:)In fact, I'm a dungeon master.

8
00:00:19,126 --> 00:00:20,296
(Elizabeth:)Not tonight.

9
00:00:20,461 --> 00:00:24,001
Tonight, you are a deliveryman.

10
00:00:24,173 --> 00:00:27,513
You've brought soup but, uh-oh, Raj and I
don't have enough money to pay you.

11
00:00:27,676 --> 00:00:30,636
(Elizabeth:)So we'll have to come
to some other kind of arrangement.

12
00:00:35,351 --> 00:00:37,141
(Howard:)Beg pardon?

13
00:00:37,686 --> 00:00:40,686
You figure out the details.
I'm gonna change into something...

14
00:00:40,856 --> 00:00:43,486
(Elizabeth:)...I don't mind getting ripped off
my milky flesh.

15
00:00:45,694 --> 00:00:47,904
(Howard:)What the frak?

16
00:00:48,489 --> 00:00:49,529
(Raj:)Go away.

17
00:00:49,698 --> 00:00:52,238
(Raj:)She wants New Delhi, not kosher deli.

18
00:00:52,868 --> 00:00:54,538
(Raj:)Besides, you have a girlfriend.

19
00:00:54,745 --> 00:00:56,205
(Howard:)We broke up weeks ago.

